WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Omar Haddad: Trimark Components is still below the quality threshold, they remain on the improvement plan.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Theo Marsh: What's their corrective action timeline looking like?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Omar Haddad: They've committed to updated inspection records by the end of next month.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Linda Park: If we don't see clean lots by then, we should discuss splitting volume to Northbridge.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Omar Haddad: Agreed, I'll document that contingency in the scorecard notes.
